    require_projection README.md ActiveImplementationTaskCard NONE
    require_projection docs/design/wave-1/README.md Wave1ImplementationTaskCardSet BLOCKED_BY_DATABASE_GATE
    require_projection docs/design/wave-1/README.md ActiveImplementationGovernanceTaskCard NONE
